  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Access to Maternal, Perinatal, and Sexual and Reproductive Health for Migrant and Host Communities&#x2019; Women Living in Extremely Vulnerable Conditions in Valledupar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen institutional capacities of maternal and perinatal health and sexual and reproductive health actions, trough the training of maternal health specialists in the implementation of guidelines and protocols for maternal-perinatal care with high quality standards. Likewise, this project will strengthen community capacities for maternal-perinatal promotion and the empowerment of sexual and reproductive health rights. IOM will contribute to guarantee access for migrant and host community women living in highly vulnerable conditions to comprehensive, high-quality and timely maternal-perinatal and sexual and reproductive health care in the Valledupar municipality.</narrative>
  </description>
